      "id": "chad-finchum",
      "wikidata": "Q43999056",
      "summary": {
        "text": "James Chadwick Finchum (born September 22, 1994) is an American professional stock car racing driver. He last competed part-time in the NASCAR Cup Series, driving the No. 66 Ford Mustang Dark Horse for Garage 66, and part-time in the NASCAR O'Reilly Auto Parts Series, driving the No. 35/55 Chevrolet Camaro SS for Joey Gase Motorsports with Scott Osteen. He has also previously competed in the ARCA Menards Series East.",
        "lang": "en",
        "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chad_Finchum"
